    <h1>
      <a href="/t/pep-703-making-the-global-interpreter-lock-optional-3-12-updates/26503">PEP 703: Making the Global Interpreter Lock Optional (3.12 updates)</a>
    </h1>

      <div class="topic-category" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/BreadcrumbList">
